    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37254" root="كنب" body-key="k">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَنَبَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَنُبَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُنُوبٌ</span>; and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اكنب</span></b> ;
<i>He,</i> or <i>it, was,</i> or <i>became, gross; thick, coarse;</i>
or <i>rough:</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَلُظَ</span>. (K.) See 4. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَنَبَ</span>
<i>He was,</i> or <i>became, possessed of plenty,</i> or
<i>riches:</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَغْنَى</span>. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَنَبَهُ فِى جِرَابِهِ</span>,
aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَنِبَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَنْبٌ</span>, <i>He stowed it,</i> or <i>deposited
it, in his provision-bag.</i> (K.)

